flowchart LR
  subgraph Sources
    P[Python producer]
    H[Historical CSV in GCS landing bucket]
  end
  P --> PS[Pub/Sub rh-ride-events]
  PS --> DF[Dataflow streaming]
  DF --> RAW[(BigQuery rh_raw)]
  DF -.invalid.-> REJ[(rh_raw.rejected_events)]
  H -->|Composer load job| RAW
  RAW --> SP[Dataproc Serverless PySpark]
  SP --> PQ[(Curated Parquet in GCS)]
  PQ -->|load to rh_staging| STG[(rh_staging)]
  STG -->|MERGE| CUR[(BigQuery rh_curated)]
  CUR --> DQ{DQ gate}
  DQ -->|pass| MART[rh_marts views]
  DQ -->|pass| ML[BQML ARIMA_PLUS rh_ml]
  ML --> MART
  MART --> LS[Looker Studio]
  CMP[Cloud Composer daily DAG] -.orchestrates.-> H
  CMP -.-> SP
  CMP -.-> DQ
  CMP -.-> ML
